00:02:05.917 --> 00:02:25.533
Cambodia has amazing wild animals. Gibbons swing in the trees and sing in the morning. A sun bear has a yellow mark on its chest. A pangolin has hard scales. Hornbills have big beaks. River dolphins swim in the Mekong. Banteng, pythons and leopard cats live in the forest.

